        <li><strong>Benefits Review</strong><br>
            Implement a tiered health plan option to lower premiums while preserving coverage levels.</li>
        <li><strong>Energy Efficiency Initiative</strong><br>
            Install LED lighting and solar panels in all branch locations, projected savings of $47,000 annually.</li>
    </ol>

